<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0087/na_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForceBasis> "EXPLICIT_LEXICAL" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0087/tu_0002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "2. In patients experiencing mild decrease of renal function or asymptomatic reduction of blood pressure during HF hospitalization, diuresis and other GDMT should not routinely be discontinued." .
